{"sourceUrl":"https://math.lzu.edu.cn/info/1062/5861.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:32.697577+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://math.lzu.edu.cn/info/1062/5861.htm","html":"<div><section>\n<article>\n<p><span>为增进大学生对</span><span>数学学科</span><span>的进一步了解，</span><span>促进</span><span>对数学</span><span>基础</span><span>学科有</span><span>着</span><span>浓厚兴趣</span><span>的</span><span>大学生之间的交流，增进青年学子对我院学科特色与科研氛围的全面了解，</span><span>我</span><span>院</span><span>特</span><span>举办“兰州大学数学与统计学院</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动</span><span>。</span><span>现就有关事项通知如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>活动时间</span><span>：202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8-9</span><span>日，具体活动形式见后续通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>活动名额：</span><span>40</span><span>人</span><span>左右</span></p>\n<p><span>三</span><span>、申请</span><span>条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体全面发展，遵纪守法</span><span>，</span><span>身心健康；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>有</span><span>较强专业理论基础和良好科研能力的</span><span>高水平</span><span>大学的</span><span>2027</span><span>届</span><span>毕业生</span><span>；且在校前五个学期</span><span>成绩排名年级前40％</span><span>（</span><span>所有专业课成绩及格</span><span>）</span><span>（原则上能够</span><span>在现就读学校取得推荐免试研究生资格）</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>3.英语水平良好</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.无</span><span>任何</span><span>学术不端</span><span>行为</span><span>及</span><span>违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></p>\n<p><span>四</span><span>、</span><span>申请</span><span>流程</span></p>\n<p><span>1.在线申请（通过手机微信扫描二维码填写申请信息，在线申请表只做人数统计，电子版和纸质版材料请按照通知要求提交）</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>                                                   \r\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://math.lzu.edu.cn/__local/2/56/5E/CDE09DCD970193A3AC43BDA4F66_D1D5BE62_644A.jpeg\"/>                                   </span><span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>电子</span><span>材料</span><span>提交</span></p>\n<p><span>①</span><span>20</span><span>2</span><span>6年兰州大学数学与统计学院全国优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>申请</span><span>表（见附表1）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>②</span><span>两封专家</span><span>亲笔</span><span>签名推荐信（见附表2）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>③</span><span>本科前</span><span>五个</span><span>学期成绩单（由教务部门盖章），排名年级前40％的证明（由教务部门或院系盖章）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>④</span><span>身份证</span><span>、学</span><span>生证扫描件（保证页面清晰）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>⑤</span><span>其他证明材料（如</span><span>获奖</span><span>证书、</span><span>学术论文</span><span>、英语</span><span>四六</span><span>级证书等复印件，</span><span>非必须</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><span>请</span><span>将上述申请</span><span>材料合并为一个p</span><span>df</span><span>文件，最晚于至</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日（</span><span>24:00</span><span>）前，发送至邮箱mathyjx@lzu.edu.cn（邮件主题：夏令营-本科学校（院系）-姓名）,</span><span> </span><span>逾期</span><span>不再接收申请。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.纸质材料提交</span></p>\n<p><span>申请人通过营员资格审核后，入营报到时提交《夏令营报名表》、成绩单原件</span><span>以及上述所需提交的电子材料纸质版</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>注</span><span>：网上申请</span><span>、电子</span><span>材料、纸质材料提交缺一不可</span><span>。</span><span>材料须真实有效</span><span>，因</span><span>信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请人本人承担。</span></p>\n<p><span>五、</span><span>材料审核及营员选拔</span></p>\n<p><span>学院</span><span>将</span><span>组织专家</span><span>逐一</span><span>审核评估申请者提供</span><span>的</span><span>各项材料，</span><span>择优</span><span>确定夏令营</span><span>参营名</span><span>单并报</span><span>兰州</span><span>大学研究生院审核。审核通过的夏令营参营名单将在学院网站</span><span>（http://math.lzu.edu.cn/）</span><span>公布</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>窗体顶端</span></p>\n<p><span>六</span><span>、</span><span>主要</span><span>活动内容</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.夏令营</span><span>开营</span><span>典礼</span><span>：主要包括学院介绍、导师介绍</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.讲座</span><span>与交流：主要包括</span><span>参加</span><span>学术报告</span><span>、</span><span>与研究生导师</span><span>面对面</span><span>交流、与在读研究生座谈</span><span>等；</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.文化活动</span><span>：主要包括</span><span>参观学校</span><span>、学院，</span><span>感受</span><span>学术氛围</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>七</span><span>、</span><span>注意事项</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>营员必须遵守兰州大学有关规章制度和夏令营的纪律要求，服从工作人员安排，并按时参加夏令营</span><span>期间</span><span>的各项活动</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>兰州大学</span><span>将为</span><span>评选为优秀</span><span>营员</span><span>的学生</span><span>提供夏令营期间的食宿、人身保险费以及异地学校学生往返硬座火车票/汽车票</span><span>/二等座火车票</span><span>。住宿提供双人标间，原则上要求双人入住。请自行提前预订往返车票，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></p>\n<p><span>八</span><span>、</span><span>联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系</span><span>部门：兰州大学数学与统计学院</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：</span><span>王</span><span>老师</span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：0931-</span><span>8912389</span></p>\n<p><span>地址：甘肃省兰州市城关区天水南路222号</span></p>\n<p><span>邮箱：</span><span>math</span><span>yjx</span><span>@lzu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>         </span></p>\n<p><span>数学与统计学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026年6月2日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</article>\n</section></div>","textSha256":"7cc1b26663a3cedb513d82a25e045cf9322257d531bce343cc7f9e435a760aec","textLength":1243,"sourceSha256":"144a706847bbbb1d5e10ead5ae4054782a9e6ad5cf6f9541b645b39e704e2b3f","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件2：专家推荐信.doc","url":"https://math.lzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1921479487&wbfileid=18117229"},{"name":"附件1：2026年兰州大学数学与统计学院优秀大学生夏令营报名表.doc","url":"https://math.lzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1921479487&wbfileid=18117228"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2b18201e7b50646e8d11","title":"2026年兰州大学数学与统计学院2026年第八届优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:32.697577+00:00"}
